@ ---- LBL :BACK:, LBL :FWD:, LBL :TODAY: the date - 15, + 15 days, the clock's; then only the areas whose
@ zone changed are drawn again (LBL :AREAS:), and the texts ----
LBL 17                          ; :BACK:
-15
STO+ 31
XEQ 20                          ; -> :NEWDAY:
RTN
LBL 18                          ; :FWD:
15
STO+ 31
XEQ 20                          ; -> :NEWDAY:
