@ ---- LBL :ZNOW: R40 = the zone of the area on the date R39: R74, or the zone of the season the date is
@ in (R75-R77, R78-R80; a season from start to end, around the new year when start > end) ----
LBL 23                          ; :ZNOW:
RCL 74
