RCL 76
RCL 77
XEQ 24                          ; -> :SEASON:
RCL 78
RCL 79
RCL 80
XEQ 24                          ; -> :SEASON:
@ the change to draw, R90: 0 none, 1 the upper pixels, 2 the lower ones, 3 both. The zone drawn so far, R92,
@ is the digit k - 1 in base 3 of R89 (0 at the start: nothing drawn); up = sum(new) - sum(old) with
@ sum(z) = (z + 1) div 2 (tropical and winter have the upper pixel), low = z div 2 (winter only). Not in
@ mode 0 (the texts of an area): R90 = 0, nothing drawn, R89 kept
0
STO 90
RCL 36
